OL,3,GNEWSALaura Anne Jones elected Reform's
OL,4,Adeputy Welsh leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform MS Laura Anne Jones has been
OL,7,Felected the party's deputy leader in
OL,8,FWales, the party has announced.
OL,10,FThe post was vacated after the previous
OL,11,Fdeputy leader Helen Jenner took the
OL,12,Fparty's Senedd leadership on Tuesday. A
OL,13,Fvote was held among Reform's Senedd
OL,14,Fmembers.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
