OL,3,GNEWSALaura Anne Jones elected Reform's
OL,4,Adeputy Welsh leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Jones said: "We've made
OL,7,Fa fantastic start here in the Senedd,
OL,8,Fgiving a voice to the voiceless and
OL,9,Fstanding up for Wales' left-behind
OL,10,Fcommunities. I'm excited to work with
OL,11,FHelen Jenner and the rest of our team
OL,12,Fto deliver the real change Wales
OL,13,Fneeds."
OL,15,FJenner was elected party leader after
OL,16,Fher predecessor Dan Thomas quit last
OL,17,Fweek, after he arrested on suspicion of
OL,18,Fassault and coercive or controlling
OL,19,Fbehaviour.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
